{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot searches for object, takes and performs task on it. Explores unexplored area if needed. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = PerformObjectTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToUnexploredArea    /> <Condition ID = IsRoomExplored    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
